es in local context windows, similar to CBOW but with a different objective.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'ViEW': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A method to visually enhance existing word embeddings by training an autoencoder on pre-trained word embeddings and matching intermediate representations to visual features extracted from a convolutional network trained on ImageNet.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'ELMo': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Embeddings from Language Models, a method for contextualized word representations through pre-training on language models.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'OpenAI GPT': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A method for contextualized word representations through pre-training on language models.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'BERT': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers, a method for contextualized word representations through pre-training on language models.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Transformation': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A function (φt) that maps ViCo embeddings to a type-specialized embedding space, used to capture different types of co-occurrences.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'Object-Object': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ['A type of visual co-occurrence used by ViCo, representing the co-occurrence of different objects within the same visual context.', 'A type of visual co-occurrence count computed using WordNet synsets, representing the co-occurrence of different objects within the same visual region.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4, 5]}, 'Attribute-Attribute': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ['A type of visual co-occurrence used by ViCo, representing the co-occurrence of different attributes within the same visual context.', 'A type of visual co-occurrence computed using WordNet synset annotations, specifically focusing on the co-occurrence of attributes.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4, 5]}, 'Concept-Co